# Server actions & services

- `'use server'` at the top of every `src/actions/*Actions.ts` file.
- Validate all external input with `zod`; bound quantities/limits
  (`cartActions.ts`: `MAX_QUANTITY = 99`, `MAX_LINES_PER_REQUEST = 50`).
- Rate-limit mutations (`isRateLimited` + `getClientIp` pattern).
- Thin actions → `src/services/` business logic. Never call Shopify from
  components. Return typed `{ data, message }`; never leak tokens/traces.
